    "created_at": "2016-04-25T16:17:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-25T16:17:39Z",
    "body": "What does xhr do today when used from a refreshed document?  How about dynamically created img and script elements?\n\nI personally don't like adding this global state since the spec already provides RequestCache for bypassing HTTP cache.\n\nCache mode is implemented in Firefox 48.\n",
