    "created_at": "2016-04-26T00:32:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T00:32:34Z",
    "body": "> I personally don't like adding this global state since the spec already provides RequestCache for bypassing HTTP cache.\n\nI think the reason for this proposal is giving the users control over what behavior `fetch()` has (as opposed to the developer), similar to what browsers currently are doing for the top-level resource and its subresources.\n",
