    "created_at": "2016-04-26T00:34:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T00:34:46Z",
    "body": "Note that Facebook is proposing changing what the reload button does by making it only validate the main page but not subresources, and apparently Chrome is on board.  If that behavior change gets adopted by browsers, that will change the landscape around this issue.  See https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1267474 and https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=600636.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
