    "created_at": "2016-04-26T01:26:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T01:26:10Z",
    "body": "I guess Chrome's proposal around reload probably works, and even with that, users still have hard-reload to bypass all cache and reload everything. But resources get via `fetch()` would not be revalidated even in that case.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
